    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107237" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεραναιδεύομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be surpassed in
				impudence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1206
			</span></i> (cj. <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> in Budaei et aliorum Dictionario Graecolatino, Basil. <i><span class="en">
				1565
			</span></i>, pro <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αναιδεσθήσομαι</span>);
			Dind. suggests <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεραναιδισθήσομαι,</span>
			citing <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				80
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναιδίζεσθαι: Ἀριστοφάνης
				Ἱππεῦσιν.</span></div>
